<title>POLAND: AMERBANK JULY NET RISES TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>AMERBANK JULY NET RISES TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.23 vs    0.66</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    2.55 vs    1.20</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  6.30 vs    3.34</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 8.07 vs    4.14</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.50 vs    4.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   11.77 vs    7.72</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 34.64 vs   22.21</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	45.61 vs   28.35</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Amerbank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
